# Project specific R8 rules. AGP combines all keep rule files in src/main/keepRules.
# Hilt, DataStore, Play Services and Maps Compose ship their own consumer rules.
#
# For more details, see
#   https://d.android.com/r/tools/r8/keep-rules

# Keep readable stack traces for crash reports; the mapping file de-obfuscates them.
-keepattributes SourceFile,LineNumberTable
-renamesourcefileattribute SourceFile
